mike: Adding one more detail to TS: mention that streaming payloads may be framed JSON chunks; include a minimal parser for partial JSON tokens so users can handle truncated frames.

anna: Good catch. Also, if a 429 happens we should demonstrate exponential backoff with jitter and respecting `Retry-After` header when present. I'll link that from `retries.md`.

